{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible and path clear then approach, take, process. Else randomly move. list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Action ID = RandomWalk    /> <SubTree ID = ObjectTask    />",
